      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是在現在才認識她們，我甚至想要說服她們來幫助我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她們會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道。反正現在已經不可能了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我只能判斷讓她們上船接近老頭子會有風險，盡可能做一些額外的事情拖住她們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果來說，可能我會無法上船，到時候我在陸地上配合你們就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "需要我幫忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "必要的時候會用到你，所以先和你說一聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說點輕鬆的話題吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，拉菲艾拉，你也在這座城市生活了幾年，你知道多索雷斯這個名字的來歷嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？我還真沒有聽說過......不過，既然是雙日城，是指兩個太陽吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。那你再猜猜，是哪兩個太陽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......天上的太陽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個太明顯了，我們抬頭就能看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第二個......水裡的太陽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不錯啊，我還以為你猜不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這座城市的海，將天上的太陽納入了囊中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我聽爸爸說過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你知不知道，這座城市差點改名叫特雷索雷斯，三日城的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒？三日城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，你再猜猜看，第三個太陽是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第三個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道是指市長自己？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，確實也有這種說法，坎黛拉女士就像這座城市的太陽一樣，這座城市之所以能夠存在，完全就是因為有她在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜不對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "市長是個十分高傲的人，但她的高傲並不是會自比太陽的高傲，而是在那之上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她怎麼會將自己和另外兩個太陽並列呢？她只會說，三個太陽都是她的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那第三個太陽是什麼啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "答案其實很簡單，就在你爸爸的船上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是我的養父，是你的爸爸才對好不好......誒，難道是那座很可愛的純金雕像？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，沒錯。那就是這座城市的第三個太陽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "據說，其他人好說歹說才把坎黛拉女士給勸住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有點沒勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這座城市又有什麼有勁的東西呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，我覺得哥哥你明明很享受在這裡的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看起來很享受嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不享受嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得你這幾年幫市長做事挺快樂的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我真是這樣的人，那我為什麼會協助父親？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道。我一直以為你不會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉，你的直覺總是很準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛剛還說我呆呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，繼續去準備比賽吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
